WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.815
Module 2.

00:00:01.815 --> 00:00:03.195
Trading On-Chain.

00:00:03.195 --> 00:00:05.155
Part of Stage 1, Foundations.

00:00:06.455 --> 00:00:08.721
By the end of this module, you'll

00:00:08.721 --> 00:00:11.387
be able to execute a swap deliberately,

00:00:11.387 --> 00:00:14.020
understanding price impact and MEV.

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:15.375
That's the standard.

00:00:15.375 --> 00:00:17.345
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:18.645 --> 00:00:20.709
There are 8 lessons, starting

00:00:20.709 --> 00:00:23.280
with DEXs, aggregators & routing.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.259
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:25.259 --> 00:00:27.530
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.401
If the topic is new to

00:00:30.401 --> 00:00:33.160
you, start with Mastery Starter 2.0.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.055
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:35.055 --> 00:00:37.209
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:37.209 --> 00:00:39.340
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:41.147
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:41.147 --> 00:00:43.180
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.915
Let's begin, with lesson 2.0.
